# CSS-VALUES-4#calc-range

**Range Checking** (heading)

**SHA**: hash:1c4ce22ba37b4ced4cb6360ea3d4657eb0f52ba7406d99b28f0f1a2e574ed34d

## Content

The clamping/rounding behavior of [numeric functions](CSS-VALUES-4#numeric-function) is, for [math functions](CSS-VALUES-4#math-function), only performed on the results of a [top-level calculation](CSS-VALUES-4#top-level-calculation). Nested math functions forming a [calculation tree](CSS-VALUES-4#calculation-tree) neither clamp nor round.

